<title>UK: London gold finishes weak around 12-year low.</title>
<headline>London gold finishes weak around 12-year low.</headline>
<text>
<p>GOLD - Closed at $324.25/$324.75 vs $331.30/$331.80 previously. Little movement around 12-year lows after fund sell off on Australian gold sale news. Seen weakening further.</p>
<p>SILVER - Finished easier at $4.54/$4.56.</p>
<p>PLATINUM - Also easier at $419.00/$422.00.</p>
<p>PALLADIUM - Barely changed at $190.00/$194.00.</p>
</text>
